{
  "name": "typography",
  "title": "排版",
  "titleEn": "Typography",
  "category": "foundation",
  "summary": "标题、手写副标、正文色调、引用、键位、行内代码、高亮与长文排版。",
  "when": "所有文字都优先用这些类而不是自己写字体/颜色。长文章、小说正文用 riko-prose（小说加 --read）。",
  "root": null,
  "parts": [
    {
      "class": "riko-display",
      "desc": "超大展示标题（首页主视觉）"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-h1",
      "desc": "一级标题（ZCOOL XiaoWei）"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-h2",
      "desc": "二级标题"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-h3",
      "desc": "三级标题"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-h4",
      "desc": "四级标题"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-h5",
      "desc": "五级标题"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-h6",
      "desc": "六级标题"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-hand",
      "desc": "手写体英文点缀（Caveat），可加 --ice / --accent"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-lead",
      "desc": "导语段落（大一号、次要色）"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-text",
      "desc": "正文文字，配合 --sm/--xs/--lg、--muted/--strong/--accent/--ice/--success/--warning/--danger、--read"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-caption",
      "desc": "图注/小字说明"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-eyebrow",
      "desc": "标题上方的小号字距标签"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-quote",
      "desc": "引用块（blockquote），可含 __cite"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-quote__cite",
      "desc": "引用出处"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-kbd",
      "desc": "键盘按键"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-code",
      "desc": "行内代码"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-mark",
      "desc": "高亮（--current 为当前匹配）"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-prose",
      "desc": "长文容器：自动排版内部 h1–h6、p、ul、blockquote、code、pre、table、img；--read 小说阅读、--lg、--wide"
    }
  ],
  "modifiers": [
    {
      "class": "riko-hand--ice",
      "desc": "冰蓝手写",
      "group": "tone"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-hand--accent",
      "desc": "橙色手写",
      "group": "tone"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-text--xs",
      "desc": "12px",
      "group": "size"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-text--sm",
      "desc": "14px",
      "group": "size"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-text--lg",
      "desc": "18px",
      "group": "size"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-text--muted",
      "desc": "次要色",
      "group": "tone"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-text--strong",
      "desc": "加粗强调色",
      "group": "tone"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-text--accent",
      "desc": "橙色文字",
      "group": "tone"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-text--ice",
      "desc": "冰蓝文字",
      "group": "tone"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-text--success",
      "desc": "成功色",
      "group": "tone"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-text--warning",
      "desc": "警告色",
      "group": "tone"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-text--danger",
      "desc": "危险色",
      "group": "tone"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-text--read",
      "desc": "衬线阅读字体",
      "group": "variant"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-mark--current",
      "desc": "当前搜索结果",
      "group": "variant"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-prose--read",
      "desc": "小说/散文：衬线、首行缩进、宽松行距；字号读取 --riko-reading-size",
      "group": "variant"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-prose--lg",
      "desc": "大一号",
      "group": "size"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-prose--wide",
      "desc": "取消最大宽度",
      "group": "layout"
    }
  ],
  "a11y": [
    "标题层级按语义使用 h1–h6 元素，riko-h* 只负责外观，可与元素层级不同。",
    "手写体只用于短英文点缀，不要承载重要信息。"
  ],
  "rules": [
    "标题元素加 riko-h1…riko-h6；需要手写英文副标时在旁边放 <span class=\"riko-hand\">…</span>。",
    "Markdown/CMS 输出的 HTML 包在 <article class=\"riko-prose\"> 里即可获得完整排版。",
    "修饰类必须与根类同时写：<p class=\"riko-text riko-text--muted\">。",
    "标题字体 ZCOOL XiaoWei 风格化较强（如木字旁、「于」），少数字可能不易辨认；若标题中这类字很多或要求严肃易读，可改用 style=\"font-family: var(--riko-font-read)\" 或 riko-text--read。"
  ],
  "avoid": [
    "不要写 style=\"font-family:…\" 或写死颜色。",
    "不要单独写 riko-text--muted 而漏掉 riko-text。"
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "标题 + 手写副标",
      "html": "<h2 class=\"riko-h2\">小说目录 <span class=\"riko-hand\">table of contents</span></h2>"
    },
    {
      "title": "导语与次要文字",
      "html": "<p class=\"riko-lead\">从沙滩上的第一幅画开始，踏入这个世界的边缘与深处。</p>\n<p class=\"riko-text riko-text--sm riko-text--muted\">建议先阅读已更新章节，避免剧透。</p>"
    },
    {
      "title": "小说正文",
      "html": "<article class=\"riko-prose riko-prose--read\">\n  <p>轻柔的海浪涌来，在微风的吹拂下散入金黄的沙滩。</p>\n  <p>沙滩上，一个女孩哼着欢快的歌，挥动她的画笔。</p>\n</article>"
    },
    {
      "title": "引用、键位、代码、高亮",
      "html": "<blockquote class=\"riko-quote\">愿你在字里行间找到属于自己的那片海。<cite class=\"riko-quote__cite\">《络的世界》</cite></blockquote>\n<p>按 <kbd class=\"riko-kbd\">/</kbd> 搜索，配置项 <code class=\"riko-code\">themeMode</code>，<mark class=\"riko-mark\">星星酥</mark> 今日特价。</p>"
    }
  ],
  "requires": [
    {
      "selector": ".riko-quote__cite",
      "parent": ".riko-quote",
      "message": "riko-quote__cite 必须放在 riko-quote 内"
    }
  ],
  "related": [
    "section-head",
    "icon"
  ]
}